  "printed_obligations": {
    "The Coming of Galactus": [
      "Ordinary paid2BBG Saga, initial intrinsic lore and turn-based precombat lore; four exact chapter thresholds, final sacrifice after every exact outstanding chapter packet leaves.",
      "I optional zero or one any-controller nonland permanent destruction; II/III untargeted each-opponent2 life loss; IV exact Galactus creation under captured chapter controller.",
      "Galactus legendary black16/16 Elder Alien creature, flying/trample, MV0, no haste. Mandatory any-controller land destruction on actual attack, including sole own land.",
      "Saga itself has no printed trample; migrated gated keyword removed from typed definition while physical Oracle pin unchanged."
    ],
    "U.S.Agent, John Walker": [
      "Actual hybrid base 3W OR 3B, legendary 3/2 Human Soldier Hero, both intrinsic colors; no printed keywords.",
      "SelfEnters trigger does not target. Create exact colorless noncreature Artifact Equipment token named Sturdy Shield, untapped, nonlegendary, no mana cost, mana value 0.",
      "Attach all tokens resulting from this creation event that can legally equip the exact entering object; creation still happens if recipient left, changed incarnation or is no longer a creature.",
      "Sturdy Shield attached recipient gets +1/+2 through ordinary attachment layer7c fragment; separate equip2 activation costs generic2, targets creature you control, sorcery timing. Equipment and creature controllers are independent."
    ]
  },
